# Quick manual checks (VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio / Rider).
# Sign in first, then paste the accessToken into @token.

@host = http://localhost:5111
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Catalog (public)
GET {{host}}/api/jewelry

### Sign in
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}

### Refresh an expired session
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "paste-refresh-token-here"
}

### Admin: list users
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: rating summary
GET {{host}}/api/evaluation/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
